      "text": "UPDATE: DILG Sec. Jonvic Remulla proposed banning street parking in Metro Manila from 5:00 a.m. to 10:00 p.m. to ease road congestion.\n \nMMDA Chairperson Romando Artes, meanwhile, proposed a no side-street parking policy during morning and afternoon rush hours.\n \nThe suggestions were presented in a meeting between Metro Manila mayors, the MMDA, DILG, and the PNP on Friday, August 1. | via @michael_delizo\n\nREAD: https://t.co/He8O847Z7a",
