    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1951154423004274997",
      "url": "https://x.com/MMDA/status/1951154423004274997",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/MMDA/status/1951154423004274997",
      "text": "𝐓𝐑𝐀𝐅𝐅𝐈𝐂 𝐀𝐃𝐕𝐈𝐒𝐎𝐑𝐘: The Department of Public Works and Highways (DPWH) will undertake rotomilling, asphalt overlay activities, and road repairs on the following roads starting from August 1 until August 31:\n\n1. Commonwealth Avenue fronting UP College of Kinetics to fronting Meralco Substation, Quezon City\n2 Commonwealth Avenue fronting GPPB-TSO Building to fronting UP College of Kinetics, Quezon City\n3. Quezon Avenue (eastbound) from fronting Geomachine Co., to corner Sct. Santiago Street, Quezon City\n4. Auroa Blvd. (westbound) front fronting LRT Katipunan Station (after C5 Katipunan Avenue) to Yale\n5. Aurora Blvd. (eastbound) from G. Araneta (Cubao Area) to 20th Avenue from fronting PSBA (before C5 Katipunan Avenue) to Quezon City and Marikina Boundary\n6. Quezon Avenue fronting Hi-Top Supermarket to before BIR Rd, Quezon City\n\nThe activities will be done during night-time only from 11 pm until 5 am.\n\nMotorists are advised to take alternate routes.\n\n#mmda",
